OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fpatchy light rain and fog for coastal
OL,7,Fand upland areas, although clearer
OL,8,Fspells develop briefly later. Rain
OL,9,Fturns more widespread with locally
OL,10,Fheavy bursts into Wednesday morning.
OL,11,FFresh to strong winds. Milder than
OL,12,Frecently.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FOvercast with rain, heavy
OL,15,Fin places, to start. Turning partly
OL,16,Fcloudy with rain clearing east by
OL,17,Fmidday. Mostly dry through the
OL,18,Fafternoon with showers later. Feeling
OL,19,Fwarm with easing winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
