OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FLargely dry and sunny on Thursday,
OL,7,Fclouding over later. Breezy with
OL,8,Fshowers, heavy at times, on Friday.
OL,9,FDry and cloudy to start with rain
OL,10,Flater on Saturday. Temperatures around
OL,11,Faverage.
